    "idea": "The Blind Planetarium (NEW, ASTONISHING): pitch-black void dome with zero visible ground; pulse True Lens to materialize invisible 4-cap constellation stars, shoot 3 to cross onto the central rotor, rotate the unseen sky 90 degrees, plant your lantern to anchor both Lens and rotor plate, and cross north to the Cloaked Mirror Rift!",
